# Store LF in the repo and check out LF everywhere: this tree is edited from
# Windows and from Linux sandboxes in turn, and CRLF flip-flops would make
# every sync a whole-file diff. Node, Next and PowerShell are all fine with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
